Package: hlsd
Version: 0.1.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Tsiry Sandratraina <tsiry.sndr@rocksky.app>
Homepage: https://github.com/tsirysndr/hlsd
Depends: libc6
Description: Serve live HLS (and optional MPEG-DASH) from a raw PCM audio stream
 hlsd is a pure-Rust server that reads a raw PCM s16le audio stream on
 stdin and serves it as live HLS (and optionally MPEG-DASH), segmenting
 and muxing on the fly with no external tools required. Optional lossy
 codecs (AAC, MP3, Opus) can be enabled at build time.
